.TH "CSDLC-RELEASE-PREFLIGHT" "1" "September 11, 2026" "C-SDLC v3" "ADL Operator Manual"
.SH NAME
csdlc\-release\-preflight \- check exact release\-candidate consistency
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\&csdlc release\-preflight \-\-request REQUEST
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&Checks exact candidate revision, release notes bytes, gate/inventory/evidence digests and package/lockfile consistency. Gate evidence is an input, never release authorization. This route does not tag, publish or mutate GitHub. Git status inspection disables optional locks to avoid index refresh; this observation does not grant release or mutation authority.
.PP
\&The current route is explicitly limited to repository agent\-logic/agent\-design\-language and version v0.92.1; other versions report unsupported_release_identity. Do not claim v0.92.2 release readiness from this older bounded checker.
.SH OPTIONS
\&\-\-request: Required path to a UTF\-8 JSON request of the command's request family.
.PP
\&\-\-help: Show standalone help; \-h is equivalent.
.PP
\&\-h: Show standalone help; do not combine with execution options.
.SH REQUEST
\&Release preflight Request; see csdlc\-requests(1) and docs/csdlc\-v3/man/examples/release.json.
.SH EFFECTS
\&Observation or static model only. Read findings/status, not just process exit status; no release or lifecycle activation authority is granted.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
\&csdlc release\-preflight \-\-request release\-preflight\-request.json
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\&csdlc(1), csdlc\-requests(1).
